SOULSLIKE DUNGEON

Жанр:

- Action RPG
- Soulslike
- Roguelite
- Cooperative PvE
- Dungeon Crawler
- Character-driven Adventure

Платформы:

- PC
- Mobile
- Console

Игроков:

1–4

