- combat validation;
- hit validation;
- damage;
- AI;
- loot;
- inventory;
- dungeon;
- Memory;
- Echo state;
- rewards;
- purchases;
- save/load.

Каждый RemoteEvent / RemoteFunction должен проходить server validation.

