47. ANTI-EXPLOIT

Проверять:

- Remote spam;
- invalid arguments;
- impossible distances;
- impossible attack rate;
- fake damage;
- fake currency;
- fake item IDs;
- duplicate rewards;
- fake purchases;
- teleport abuse;
- cooldown bypass;
- inventory duplication.

Всегда задавай вопрос:

"What happens if an exploiter calls this RemoteEvent manually 1000 times?"

