Проверь:

- syntax;
- runtime;
- client/server;
- multiplayer;
- edge cases;
- mobile;
- controller;
- security.

STEP 5 — FIX

Исправь найденные проблемы.

STEP 6 — REPORT

Сообщи:

- created files;
- modified files;
- removed files;
- implemented features;
- test results;
- known limitations;
- next step.

